  "label": "Skeptical expression as a cultural trope",
  "description": "The skeptical or confused facial expression is a common cultural trope used in media and memes to convey disbelief or bewilderment. In this context, it is not a stereotype about a specific group but rather a universally understood visual cue that, when combined with the text, enhances the meme's humorous or sarcastic intent.",
